    {
      "bbox": [
        225,
        1381,
        1488,
        1568
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whenever Heads of Departments or mayoral agencies (including Acting Heads of Departments) are considering plans to make an official trip requiring their absence from the city, the Mayor's office will be informed as far in advance as possible by written notification to the Deputy Mayor.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2868,
          "min": -1.4389
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 51,
          "mean": -0.0009,
          "min": -0.0431
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 6495,
        "area_px": 235188,
        "density": 0.02762,
        "chars": 286,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 44.03
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        222,
        1590,
        1445,
        1700
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Official trips undertaken on city time and/or city expense shall not be made unless the reasons are consistent with the following policy:",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2535,
          "min": -1.36
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 24,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0004
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 2620,
        "area_px": 134199,
        "density": 0.01952,
        "chars": 137,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 52.29
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        220,
        1728,
        1485,
        1941
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "An official trip of any representative of a city department or mayoral agency shall not be undertaken unless the purpose of the trip is such that (1) substantial benefits \"actually essential\" to the city will result, and (2) these benefits could not be realized in any other manner than by the trip of the official or his representative.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2651,
          "min": -1.3759
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 67,
          "mean": -0.0032,
          "min": -0.1059
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 7252,
        "area_px": 268320,
        "density": 0.02703,
        "chars": 337,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 46.47
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        216,
        1968,
        1442,
        2288
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Trips to conventions, conferences, surveys and inspections that are principally routine affairs with only a general relationship to the business of the department or agency are not of a type described as \"actually essential\" to city business. Before an official trip is planned, a studied determination will be made that it is, (a) actually essential and, (b) the information or other benefit to be obtained could not, in any other manner, be made available to the interested department or agency.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2653,
          "min": -1.4254
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
